ass='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Yep, it sure is!<br \/> <br \/> In Punta Cana ... there are three.<br \/> <br \/> Based on price (low to high) they are:<br \/> <br \/> Melia Tropical<br \/> <br \/> Paradisus Punta Cana<br \/> <br \/> Paradisus Palma Real<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Oh ok, cool. The Paradisus (both of them) look gorgeous.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8cc39b3127ccec5b04ffd9d7100000060O08YaNWzVw4B7efCQ\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D400\/ry%3D300\/\">http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8...D400\/ry%3D300\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8cc01b3127ccec5bd800e20a600000060O08YaNWzVw4B7efCQ\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D400\/ry%3D200\/\">http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8...D400\/ry%3D200\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20081122\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6784\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...6784\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"misstorres13@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1199513791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208131.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LadyCheese","Id":208131,"Name":"LadyCheese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b3099afc89d4dbfd3ae22b4ebbed067","RawContent":"Is it just me, or is it crazy to be paying for dinner at an all-inclusive?!\n \n I guess thats just how all the resorts are...?","Attachments":[],"Id":219265,"PostDate":1204857163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Is it just me, or is it crazy to be paying for dinner at an all-inclusive?!<br \/> <br \/> I guess thats just how all the resorts are...?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweetpea_ndh@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1204331092,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208690.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nde062010","Id":208690,"Name":"nde062010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d4a4bfd2dfe0489d97eee02e18fc173","RawContent":"I too though that payig for dinner at an AI was ridiculous. But then I thought about it and it kinda makes sense. When you have a private reception, you actually get your &#039;own&#039; space for your party. They also provide your event with your own servers and open bar and bartender. They are taking staff away from the other guests just to attend to your needs, set up and clean up for your event, so it makes some sense. Now, what I can&#039;t understand is why each menu has a different price.","Attachments":[],"Id":219843,"PostDate":1204882406,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I too though that payig for dinner at an AI was ridiculous. But then I thought about it and it kinda makes sense. When you have a private reception, you actually get your 'own' space for your party. They also provide your event with your own servers and open bar and bartender. They are taking staff away from the other guests just to attend to your needs, set up and clean up for your event, so it makes some sense. Now, what I can't understand is why each menu has a different price.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Loving Married Life!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ticia277@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1198918901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208072.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":54,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ticia277","Id":208072,"Name":"ticia277","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88fdded5aff2b3dc349401465e0e0559","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ticia277&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I too though that payig for dinner at an AI was ridiculous. But then I thought about it and it kinda makes sense. When you have a private reception, you actually get your &#039;own&#039; space for your party. They also provide your event with your own servers and open bar and bartender. They are taking staff away from the other guests just to attend to your needs, set up and clean up for your event, so it makes some sense. Now, what I can&#039;t understand is why each menu has a different price.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I dont understand the pricing either...and when they say &amp;quot;pick one&amp;quot; for the main entree, are they telling us the bride to pick one or will the guest be able to choose one?? I&#039;m thinking its the former but still, if I decide I want to pick the fish not everyone eats fish...they should let the guest have two options: chicken or fish, etc....do you know how it works Ticia?","Attachments":[],"Id":223702,"PostDate":1205209919,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ticia277<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I too though that payig for dinner at an AI was ridiculous. But then I thought about it and it kinda makes sense. When you have a private reception, you actually get your 'own' space for your party. They also provide your event with your own servers and open bar and bartender. They are taking staff away from the other guests just to attend to your needs, set up and clean up for your event, so it makes some sense. Now, what I can't understand is why each menu has a different price.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I dont understand the pricing either...and when they say \"pick one\" for the main entree, are they telling us the bride to pick one or will the guest be able to choose one?? I'm thinking its the former but still, if I decide I want to pick the fish not everyone eats fish...they should let the guest have two options: chicken or fish, etc....do you know how it works Ticia?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8cc39b3127ccec5b04ffd9d7100000060O08YaNWzVw4B7efCQ\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D400\/ry%3D300\/\">http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8...D400\/ry%3D300\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8cc01b3127ccec5bd800e20a600000060O08YaNWzVw4B7efCQ\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D400\/ry%3D200\/\">http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8...D400\/ry%3D200\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20081122\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6784\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...6784\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"misstorres13@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1199513791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208131.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LadyCheese","Id":208131,"Name":"LadyCheese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e4bc4a73b646df16e8235b7429e98a8","RawContent":"You pick what you want the meal to be at the wedding. When I emailed Grisel about this, she said that they can accommodate for other guests who don&#039;t eat what you have chosen. But I think it&#039;s only for a handful of guests. I chose the beef, but I have 2 people who don&#039;t eat beef, so I will order chicken for them when I get there.","Attachments":[],"Id":223878,"PostDate":1205218763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You pick what you want the meal to be at the wedding. When I emailed Grisel about this, she said that they can accommodate for other guests who don't eat what you have chosen. But I think it's only for a handful of guests. I chose the beef, but I have 2 people who don't eat beef, so I will order chicken for them when I get there.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Loving Married Life!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ticia277@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1198918901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208072.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":54,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ticia277","Id":208072,"Name":"ticia277","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0874239a0b73486ac383e80d1ef3733","RawContent":"Hi ladies. I was just wondering if any of you have received a new coordinator. It seems that Grisel has joined the EdenH and I was wondering if she was working at both resorts!","Attachments":[],"Id":224023,"PostDate":1205249894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies. I was just wondering if any of you have received a new coordinator. It seems that Grisel has joined the EdenH and I was wondering if she was working at both resorts!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>2 Hearts, 1 Love 08.08.08Punta Cana, D.R.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rchristinah@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1183314115,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207507.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":91,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"twinkletoes","Id":207507,"Name":"twinkletoes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ab1cf0a9994b5ba0ac22d2b7e92b6bd","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ticia277&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;You pick what you want the meal to be at the wedding. When I emailed Grisel about this, she said that they can accommodate for other guests who don&#039;t eat what you have chosen. But I think it&#039;s only for a handful of guests. I chose the beef, but I have 2 people who don&#039;t eat beef, so I will order chicken for them when I get there.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Ok cool. Thanks for the info.","Attachments":[],"Id":225326,"PostDate":1205336332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ticia277<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">You pick what you want the meal to be at the wedding. When I emailed Grisel about this, she said that they can accommodate for other guests who don't eat what you have chosen. But I think it's only for a handful of guests. I chose the beef, but I have 2 people who don't eat beef, so I will order chicken for them when I get there.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Ok cool. Thanks for the info.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8cc39b3127ccec5b04ffd9d7100000060O08YaNWzVw4B7efCQ\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D400\/ry%3D300\/\">http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8...D400\/ry%3D300\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8cc01b3127ccec5bd800e20a600000060O08YaNWzVw4B7efCQ\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D400\/ry%3D200\/\">http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8...D400\/ry%3D200\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20081122\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6784\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...6784\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"misstorres13@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1199513791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208131.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LadyCheese","Id":208131,"Name":"LadyCheese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47587cd5b4f36e1996f1dde611b61bd3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;twinkletoes&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi ladies. I was just wondering if any of you have received a new coordinator. It seems that Grisel has joined the EdenH and I was wondering if she was working at both resorts!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Ive only dealt with Miguelina at Dreams but I know a few other girls were working with Grisele maybe they will have more info on this.","Attachments":[],"Id":225327,"PostDate":1205336410,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpad