data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20081122\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6784\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...6784\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"misstorres13@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1199513791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208131.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LadyCheese","Id":208131,"Name":"LadyCheese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"911641932109b9017b57e2f615b82f5d","RawContent":"Has Anyone Used Dreams Resorts Photograher Or Know Someone Who Did?has Anyone Recieved Info Or Samples Of Their Work?","Attachments":[],"Id":491197,"PostDate":1225095612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has Anyone Used Dreams Resorts Photograher Or Know Someone Who Did?has Anyone Recieved Info Or Samples Of Their Work?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"JAXL63@YAHOO.COM","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1212539357,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209740.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JAXLL","Id":209740,"Name":"JAXLL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2039491fa415cdf90ca8f0c09bc707cf","RawContent":"I really don&#039;t understanding some concerns about Dreams locations. \n Like the most of resorts they have the weddings what they can take care.\n Actually I`m in contact with WC,(I`m photographer) and they are absolutely open about our services taking place in there, and they sound so nice.\n Lot of people get weddings in Dreams or Paradisus as well.\n Every place have differences, but they are good for wedding.\n Do you need take care about details, time and locations before go to booking time.\n Enclose &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/stock.dfotoart.com\/openbar.jpg\"&gt;HERE&lt;\/a&gt; open bar (in Paradisus) for those asking about it.\n Be relaxed, ask about everything, and keep up your wedding planning.\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/dfotoart.com\"&gt;Juan Guzman dfotoart&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":494942,"PostDate":1225385618,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I really don't understanding some concerns about Dreams locations. <br \/> Like the most of resorts they have the weddings what they can take care.<br \/> Actually I`m in contact with WC,(I`m photographer) and they are absolutely open about our services taking place in there, and they sound so nice.<br \/> Lot of people get weddings in Dreams or Paradisus as well.<br \/> Every place have differences, but they are good for wedding.<br \/> Do you need take care about details, time and locations before go to booking time.<br \/> Enclose <a href='http:\/\/stock.dfotoart.com\/openbar.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>HERE<\/a> open bar (in Paradisus) for those asking about it.<br \/> Be relaxed, ask about everything, and keep up your wedding planning.<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/dfotoart.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Juan Guzman dfotoart<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@dfotoart.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1208846064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209159.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":65,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Juan Guzman dfotoart","Id":209159,"Name":"Juan Guzman dfotoart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5b5ed4606db73cf070ea41d43134282","RawContent":"Hi, Mogroom. I&#039;m pretty new to the forum and was interested in having my wedding (75 guests) on the beach wih a private reception and open bar. I emailed the coordinator three times last week, but she hasn&#039;t responded yet. Do you have pictures, ceremony pricing, bar pricing, and pricing for a private ceremony? Whatever you have would be greatly appreciated. You can email it to me at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:mary@marybrealty.com\"&gt;mary@marybrealty.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Thanks so much.\n - Mary","Attachments":[],"Id":495156,"PostDate":1225395643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, Mogroom. I'm pretty new to the forum and was interested in having my wedding (75 guests) on the beach wih a private reception and open bar. I emailed the coordinator three times last week, but she hasn't responded yet. Do you have pictures, ceremony pricing, bar pricing, and pricing for a private ceremony? Whatever you have would be greatly appreciated. You can email it to me at <a href='mailto:mary@marybrealty.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>mary@marybrealty.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Thanks so much.<br \/> - Mary\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mary@marybrealty.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1224371849,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212316.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"uspoiledme","Id":212316,"Name":"uspoiledme","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a0ca00ce557f49651afca6a92ba77a3","RawContent":"Congrats! Sounds like a good time","Attachments":[],"Id":495565,"PostDate":1225412470,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats! Sounds like a good time\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sjcoregon6@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1210724436,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209387.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sjcoregon6","Id":209387,"Name":"sjcoregon6","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc3c76d5543f98a9607b38642ebc2fd0","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;VariaStudio&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Shelley,\n \n I am at the Dreams Resort right now. \n I shot a wedding here yesterday and resort had 2 other weddings happening at the same day.\n \n It is a beautiful resort and it has a lots of great spots for photography!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Varia,\n \n Thank you for posting! \n \n Ooooh, I&#039;m getting really excited now, with only 3 weeks to the day until our wedding. \n \n My photographer has been to Dreams before, so I know she&#039;ll have all sorts of great ideas. I&#039;ve put my trust in her. \n \n Thanks, can&#039;t wait to see teasers on your website when you get back.","Attachments":[],"Id":499730,"PostDate":1225835673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>VariaStudio<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Shelley,<br \/> <br \/> I am at the Dreams Resort right now. <br \/> I shot a wedding here yesterday and resort had 2 other weddings happening at the same day.<br \/> <br \/> It is a beautiful resort and it has a lots of great spots for photography!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Varia,<br \/> <br \/> Thank you for posting! <br \/> <br \/> Ooooh, I'm getting really excited now, with only 3 weeks to the day until our wedding. <br \/> <br \/> My photographer has been to Dreams before, so I know she'll have all sorts of great ideas. I've put my trust in her. <br \/> <br \/> Thanks, can't wait to see teasers on your website when you get back.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelley.brule@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1212540720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209743.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chika","Id":209743,"Name":"chika","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0f12e97f2d81dd24452c3a5ecd37d6a","RawContent":"Hello Dreams Punta Cana Brides.\n I am really considering Dreams Punta Cana for our wedding\n All of you are great with your feedback and are helping the decision making easier...","Attachments":[],"Id":504986,"PostDate":1226292510,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello Dreams Punta Cana Brides.<br \/> I am really considering Dreams Punta Cana for our wedding<br \/> All of you are great with your feedback and are helping the decision making easier...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisacdean83@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1224791847,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212374.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaB","Id":212374,"Name":"LisaB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9df83a9513475bb8e7355b3dfdabd396","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;uspoiledme&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi, Mogroom. I&#039;m pretty new to the forum and was interested in having my wedding (75 guests) on the beach wih a private reception and open bar. I emailed the coordinator three times last week, but she hasn&#039;t responded yet. Do you have pictures, ceremony pricing, bar pricing, and pricing for a private ceremony? Whatever you have would be greatly appreciated. You can email it to me at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:mary@marybrealty.com\"&gt;mary@marybrealty.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Thanks so much.\n - Mary&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Mary, have you heard from any of the coordinator yet. They can do this I believe as long as you do one of the private dinners, it will cost you though. I have seen a picture of a reception set up on the beach, it was beautiful. have you looked at the forum for the dreams resort itself, there a gal there with lots of photos and info. she has also been helpful in talking to the resorts for brides and getting answers. I also know that they usually take 3 weeks to respond to anything and sometimes the answer isn&#039;t what you are even asking about or it is a generic message.\n I hope this helps\n Laura","Attachments":[],"Id":506760,"PostDate":1226445293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>uspoiledme<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi, Mogroom. I'm pretty new to the forum and was interested in having my wedding (75 guests) on the beach wih a private reception and open bar. I emailed the coordinator three times last week, but she hasn't responded yet. Do you have pictures, ceremony pricing, bar pricing, and pricing for a private ceremony? Whatever you have would be greatly appreciated. You can email it to me at <a href='mailto:mary@marybrealty.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>mary@marybrealty.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Thanks so much.<br \/> - Mary<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Mary, have you heard from any of the coordinator yet. They can do this I believe as long as you do one of the private dinners, it will cost you though. I have seen a picture of a reception set up on the beach, it was beautiful. have you looked at the forum for the dreams resort itself, there a gal there with lots of photos and info. she has also been helpful in talking to the resorts for brides and getting answers. I also know that they usually take 3 weeks to respond to anything and sometimes the answer isn't what you are even asking about or it is a generic message.<br \/> I hope this helps<br \/> Laura\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/3IrCm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/3IrCm4\/.png<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span>[url=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/weight-loss\/wicGfvN\/%5D\">http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/weight-loss\/wicGfvN\/]<\/a><br \/>\n<span>[img]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"llmg970@netzero.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219695545,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211372.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lmg970","Id":211372,"Name":"lmg970","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be32127c9e6a4bc3bc8ebf3651d2981c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;uspoiledme&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi, Mogroom. I&#039;m pretty new to the forum and was interested in having my wedding (75 guests) on the beach wih a private reception and open bar. I emailed the coordinator three times last week, but she hasn&#039;t responded yet. Do you have pictures, ceremony pricing, bar pricing, and pricing for a private ceremony? Whatever you have would be greatly appreciated. You can email it to me at &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i261.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii75\/kimba1177\/WEDDING%20PLANS\/BeachCeremonySetUp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i261.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii75\/kimba1177\/WEDDING%20PLANS\/Montajeplaya.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":524969,"PostDate":1228286087,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>uspoiledme<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi, Mogroom. I'm pretty new to the forum and was interested in having my wedding (75 guests) on the beach wih a private reception and open bar. I emailed the coordinator three times last week, but she hasn't responded yet. Do you have pictures, ceremony pricing, bar pricing, and pricing for a private ceremony? Whatever you have would be greatly appreciated. You can email it to me at <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i261.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii75\/kimba1177\/WEDDING%20PLANS\/BeachCeremonySetUp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i261.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii75\/kimba1177\/WEDDING%20PLANS\/Montajeplaya.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>visit my wedsite @ <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_Lennon_wedsite\/How_we_Met.html\">http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_...ow_we_Met.html<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;116\/st\/20090404\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/e37d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e37d\/event.png<\/a><br><span>28 Guests Booked so far!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kimba1177@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201082886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208333.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"S2BLennon","Id":208333,"Name":"S2BLennon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"522a281e036ca923cf8580745709ca5f","RawContent":"I love the beach reception setup. very pretty","Attachments":[],"Id":525009,"PostDate":1228287883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=