":"Member","JoinDate":1207271866,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209009.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":96,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Princess402","Id":209009,"Name":"Princess402","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c07a70ad35aa8f293be21f2a74c32f7","RawContent":"Those are the current prices that we were qouted, and we have based our budget on what is posted. That is also what the wc sent to me via email.","Attachments":[],"Id":544214,"PostDate":1230697747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Those are the current prices that we were qouted, and we have based our budget on what is posted. That is also what the wc sent to me via email.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>visit my wedsite @ <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_Lennon_wedsite\/How_we_Met.html\">http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_...ow_we_Met.html<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;116\/st\/20090404\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/e37d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e37d\/event.png<\/a><br><span>28 Guests Booked so far!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kimba1177@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201082886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208333.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"S2BLennon","Id":208333,"Name":"S2BLennon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f9d6f9a1f40d8c27be88a979c4bae40","RawContent":"hey ladies\n I have recently fallen in LOVE with Dreams punta cana resort and spa!!! I REALLY want to have my wedding so reading this forum and everyones comments is a great help for me :)","Attachments":[],"Id":544350,"PostDate":1230705073,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hey ladies<br \/> I have recently fallen in LOVE with Dreams punta cana resort and spa!!! I REALLY want to have my wedding so reading this forum and everyones comments is a great help for me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cforrer1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1230500078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213379.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cforrer1","Id":213379,"Name":"cforrer1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17d16d7426f8808accf5001e29f30215","RawContent":"Glad we were able to help! and welcome to the forum!","Attachments":[],"Id":544521,"PostDate":1230718532,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Glad we were able to help! and welcome to the forum!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>visit my wedsite @ <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_Lennon_wedsite\/How_we_Met.html\">http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_...ow_we_Met.html<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;116\/st\/20090404\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/e37d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e37d\/event.png<\/a><br><span>28 Guests Booked so far!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kimba1177@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201082886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208333.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"S2BLennon","Id":208333,"Name":"S2BLennon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1028c7bb6e37e489df036b4e49b3472f","RawContent":"Hi everyone! Im getting married at Dreams PUJ 3 months from today. The time of my wedding on July 1st (CANADA DAY!!!) is at 2:00pm... Im wondering if this is going to be too early. I plan on having a private reception dinner at the Bordeaux Terrace but Im not sure when they start the dinners. Im assuming around 6pmish... any suggestions?","Attachments":[],"Id":639261,"PostDate":1238641426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! Im getting married at Dreams PUJ 3 months from today. The time of my wedding on July 1st (CANADA DAY!!!) is at 2:00pm... Im wondering if this is going to be too early. I plan on having a private reception dinner at the Bordeaux Terrace but Im not sure when they start the dinners. Im assuming around 6pmish... any suggestions?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;405\/st\/20090701\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Punta+Cana\/k\/749d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...749d\/event.png<\/a><br><br><strong>37 PEOPLE BOOKED!!!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kylie_felix@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231484421,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/3\/3f\/3f6cc7d2_wedding?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DreamsBride09","Id":213749,"Name":"DreamsBride09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db5458e46b8da6ef8e5ee848d911ea6f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;DreamsBride09&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi everyone! Im getting married at Dreams PUJ 3 months from today. The time of my wedding on July 1st (CANADA DAY!!!) is at 2:00pm... Im wondering if this is going to be too early. I plan on having a private reception dinner at the Bordeaux Terrace but Im not sure when they start the dinners. Im assuming around 6pmish... any suggestions?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi DreamsBride09,\n \n As a photographer, I always recommend to book the wedding ceremony at 3pm or 4pm. The best time for pictures is anytime after 3pm, I find 2pm is too early and the lighting is very harsh between 11am-3pm. \n \n Varia","Attachments":[],"Id":643085,"PostDate":1238963709,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>DreamsBride09<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi everyone! Im getting married at Dreams PUJ 3 months from today. The time of my wedding on July 1st (CANADA DAY!!!) is at 2:00pm... Im wondering if this is going to be too early. I plan on having a private reception dinner at the Bordeaux Terrace but Im not sure when they start the dinners. Im assuming around 6pmish... any suggestions?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi DreamsBride09,<br \/> <br \/> As a photographer, I always recommend to book the wedding ceremony at 3pm or 4pm. The best time for pictures is anytime after 3pm, I find 2pm is too early and the lighting is very harsh between 11am-3pm. <br \/> <br \/> Varia\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"varyshka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1193082240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207873.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":74,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Varia","Id":207873,"Name":"Varia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"472057029b4469b39446ff96fd6e38e5","RawContent":"WOW, this post if very helpful thank you all. \n \n Dreams is one of the options I am looking at for our DW. The pictures of the beach set up are beautiful and the pricing has also been helpful. I noticed a few of you had questions on the pricing. The biggest tip I can give from others is to have keep ALL documentation on pricing. Any final agreements, invoices etc. If you have something in black and white it is easier to stand firm on the final invoice. I&#039;ve read that a lot of invoices will hike up the price. Having this information will allow you to argue\/stand firm with them.","Attachments":[],"Id":647243,"PostDate":1239240930,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                WOW, this post if very helpful thank you all. <br \/> <br \/> Dreams is one of the options I am looking at for our DW. The pictures of the beach set up are beautiful and the pricing has also been helpful. I noticed a few of you had questions on the pricing. The biggest tip I can give from others is to have keep ALL documentation on pricing. Any final agreements, invoices etc. If you have something in black and white it is easier to stand firm on the final invoice. I've read that a lot of invoices will hike up the price. Having this information will allow you to argue\/stand firm with them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Holly.Johnson85@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1239228670,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216571.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chris & Holly","Id":216571,"Name":"Chris & Holly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7727ecd96fa3672508ec136391ab283","RawContent":"I too am under the impression that open bar is included","Attachments":[],"Id":653862,"PostDate":1239749411,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I too am under the impression that open bar is included\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hammerb44@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229664788,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213262.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hammerb44","Id":213262,"Name":"hammerb44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ccce84e898b8b8c927d56e702af8a62","RawContent":"I am thinking about the Dreams resort. This seems to be one of the more affordable resorts...am I assuming correctly?","Attachments":[],"Id":657907,"PostDate":1239953837,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am thinking about the Dreams resort. This seems to be one of the more affordable resorts...am I assuming correctly?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;405\/st\/20100508\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-3\/k\/e53f\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e53f\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"zoetwin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1239180017,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216561.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":66,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"zoetwin","Id":216561,"Name":"zoetwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5517a6405231cc5947b5a354176c335d","RawContent":"hey zoetwin! it probably depends on the time of year, but dreams i believe dreams is considered one of the more affordable resorts in PC. i see that your wedding date is only a few days after mine! through our TA we&#039;ve gotten a few different prices for rooms during that time of year so far but not all the packages are out yet. based on what we&#039;ve seen though, prices should be fairly comparable to what they are this year, especially with the economy!","Attachments":[],"Id":658435,"PostDate":1240005730,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hey zoetwin! it probably depends on the time of year, but dreams i believe dreams is considered one of the more affordable resorts in PC. i see that your wedding date is only a few days after mine! through our TA we've gotten a few different prices for rooms during that time of year so far but not all the packages are out yet. based on what we've seen though, prices should be fairly comparable to what they are this year, especially with the economy!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i721.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww211\/ebredhawk\/ejttd_0008.jpg\">http:\/\/i721.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...ejttd_0008.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/blog.eyespy-weddings.com\/\">eyespy photography<\/a><br><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/dreams-punta-cana-la-barcaza-review-4-28-10-super-long-58714\">my Dreams Punta Cana\/La Barcaza review<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ebredhawk@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1234834018,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214967.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ebredhawk","Id":214967,"Name":"ebredhawk","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4753,"TotalPages":476,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":4750},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
