{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02e99ca1b8558aae6f047be53a0ac2e8","RawContent":"Thanks for all the great info! I&#039;m also looking into the Dreams resort in Punta Cana. All the pix really help.","Attachments":[],"Id":660022,"PostDate":1240174681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for all the great info! I'm also looking into the Dreams resort in Punta Cana. All the pix really help.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickyphan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240111623,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216819.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vickyphan","Id":216819,"Name":"vickyphan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d15bc960105f6db4574cdeb579401afa","RawContent":"I did confirm with Deyanira (sp?) my new wedding coordinator that the bar is included with a private dinner \/ reception. Did anyone else used to use Miguelina and now she is gone? I was very nervous because I received an email from Deyanira asking me the date and time of my wedding... its only just over 2 months away... shouldn&#039;t they know this info? Also, I am having a legal ceremony, but have just been told that the judge &amp;quot;might not&amp;quot; be there... and he might be there another day or later in the evening for us to sign the papers and the wedding coordinators will just perform the ceremony. Isn&#039;t this why I am paying $300USD for a judge (I realize it is for the documents aswell). It just seems strange to me. Maybe I&#039;m just stressing to much! LOL!","Attachments":[],"Id":663248,"PostDate":1240372585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I did confirm with Deyanira (sp?) my new wedding coordinator that the bar is included with a private dinner \/ reception. Did anyone else used to use Miguelina and now she is gone? I was very nervous because I received an email from Deyanira asking me the date and time of my wedding... its only just over 2 months away... shouldn't they know this info? Also, I am having a legal ceremony, but have just been told that the judge \"might not\" be there... and he might be there another day or later in the evening for us to sign the papers and the wedding coordinators will just perform the ceremony. Isn't this why I am paying $300USD for a judge (I realize it is for the documents aswell). It just seems strange to me. Maybe I'm just stressing to much! LOL!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;405\/st\/20090701\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Punta+Cana\/k\/749d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...749d\/event.png<\/a><br><br><strong>37 PEOPLE BOOKED!!!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kylie_felix@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231484421,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/3\/3f\/3f6cc7d2_wedding?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DreamsBride09","Id":213749,"Name":"DreamsBride09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63dbcf7f0705b44319135fd8af36db81","RawContent":"I am considering Dreams Punta Cana for our wedding also, does anyone have pictures of reception locations?","Attachments":[],"Id":664132,"PostDate":1240434827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am considering Dreams Punta Cana for our wedding also, does anyone have pictures of reception locations?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abrowab@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240351778,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216903.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anbrkl2010","Id":216903,"Name":"anbrkl2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4616f27efed69b67c278bfb46b07ce6","RawContent":"if you do a search within the forum for these pictures you should be able to find plenty! also, check out the dreams resort forums (on their official page, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamsresorts.com\"&gt;Dreams Resorts &amp;amp; Spas: Unlimited Luxury&lt;\/a&gt;) for tons of information too!\n \n dreamsbride.. I didn&#039;t realize Miguelina had left? has anyone else had issues with this?","Attachments":[],"Id":664320,"PostDate":1240441115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                if you do a search within the forum for these pictures you should be able to find plenty! also, check out the dreams resort forums (on their official page, <a href='http:\/\/www.dreamsresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dreams Resorts & Spas: Unlimited Luxury<\/a>) for tons of information too!<br \/> <br \/> dreamsbride.. I didn't realize Miguelina had left? has anyone else had issues with this?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i721.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww211\/ebredhawk\/ejttd_0008.jpg\">http:\/\/i721.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...ejttd_0008.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/blog.eyespy-weddings.com\/\">eyespy photography<\/a><br><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/dreams-punta-cana-la-barcaza-review-4-28-10-super-long-58714\">my Dreams Punta Cana\/La Barcaza review<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ebredhawk@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1234834018,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214967.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ebredhawk","Id":214967,"Name":"ebredhawk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c7afb199834fd70af736f7f417ed82b","RawContent":"I didn&#039;t know Miguelina had left either! My wedding is coming up very soon and I have not heard from the new coordinator.","Attachments":[],"Id":664382,"PostDate":1240442986,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I didn't know Miguelina had left either! My wedding is coming up very soon and I have not heard from the new coordinator.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Our Pro Pic slideshow by Tammy B Photography<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tammybphotography.com\/index2.php?v=v1\">http:\/\/www.tammybphotography.com\/index2.php?v=v1<\/a><br><br><span>Our Pro Pic slideshow by Melissa Green Photography<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.melissagreen-photography.com\/index2.php#\/featured\/\">http:\/\/www.melissagreen-photography....php#\/featured\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"andreachayes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1235087465,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215071.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ACH2009","Id":215071,"Name":"ACH2009","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f4af2b50d185f0b3d2cd88ef1e194c3","RawContent":"I didn&#039;t know that Migeulina had left either... Eek.","Attachments":[],"Id":664501,"PostDate":1240446934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I didn't know that Migeulina had left either... Eek.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Shannon<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/RichandShannon\">http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/RichandShannon<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannonettaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1219875173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211413.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sunsetbride1","Id":211413,"Name":"sunsetbride1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a21e0e70ee247e8e649d8078c5b3fac","RawContent":"Hi Everyone!\n \n My fiance and I are looking at Dreams for our wedding next year. We currently live in Houston, but are from Saint John, New Brunswick. We wonder if a July wedding in the DR will be too hot for our New Brunswick relatives?!? Any thoughts?","Attachments":[],"Id":666228,"PostDate":1240547070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Everyone!<br \/> <br \/> My fiance and I are looking at Dreams for our wedding next year. We currently live in Houston, but are from Saint John, New Brunswick. We wonder if a July wedding in the DR will be too hot for our New Brunswick relatives?!? Any thoughts?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"irishamber31@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238732643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216413.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"irishamber31","Id":216413,"Name":"irishamber31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6dd4ec24281778727e3f4f248883437d","RawContent":"We have been given Sharon as our coordinator and since we are just a few weeks out she has been good so far about returning emails etc....once we get back I&#039;ll let people know how things went! Our WC has changed 3 times since we started planning at DREAMS!!! but I am sure things will be fine!\n \n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;sunsetbride1&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I didn&#039;t know that Migeulina had left either... Eek.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":668320,"PostDate":1240698767,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We have been given Sharon as our coordinator and since we are just a few weeks out she has been good so far about returning emails etc....once we get back I'll let people know how things went! Our WC has changed 3 times since we started planning at DREAMS!!! but I am sure things will be fine!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>sunsetbride1<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I didn't know that Migeulina had left either... Eek.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meagryan1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201816693,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208426.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"happygilmore","Id":208426,"Name":"happygilmore","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01db0fc67446ff3ac3303ea1ee944294","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;irishamber31&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Everyone!\n \n My fiance and I are looking at Dreams for our wedding next year. We currently live in Houston, but are from Saint John, New Brunswick. We wonder if a July wedding in the DR will be too hot for our New Brunswick relatives?!? Any thoughts?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;A newfie lol j\/k :P Is NB humid in the summer? For some reason i thought it was.... but I could be wrong. it&#039;s been a while since I was there last. Anyways a good source to check out is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.wunderground.com\"&gt;Welcome to Weather Underground : Weather Underground&lt;\/a&gt; look up Punta cana and go look at the historic temps for past July. As long as everyone stays hydrated, wears uv protection (sunscreen, hats etc) they should be fine. \n \n The ceremony is usually 25 minutes tops.... and you could always plan it for later in the afternoon. We also asked our WC to provide some ice water with glasses for our guests especially our grandparents. It was 109 degrees and it was very humid.","Attachments":[],"Id":668326,"PostDate":1240699125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>irishamber31<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Everyone!<br \/> <br \/> My fiance and I are looking at Dreams for our wedding next year. We currently live in Houston, but are from Saint John, New Brunswick. We wonder if a July wedding in the DR will be too hot for our New Brunswick relatives?!? Any thoughts?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>A newfie lol j\/k <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> Is NB humid in the summer? For some reason i thought it was.... but I could be wrong. it's been a while since I was there last. Anyways a good source to check out is <a href='http:\/\/www.wunderground.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Welcome to Weather Underground : Weather Underground<\/a> look up Punta cana and go look at the historic temps for past July. As long as everyone stays hydrated, wears uv protection (sunscreen, hats etc) they should be fine. <br \/> <br \/> The ceremony is usually 25 minutes tops.... and you could always plan it for later in the afternoon. We also asked our WC to provide some ice water with glasses for our guests especially our grandparents. It was 109 degrees and it was very humid.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.ayotte@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.27.238.196","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1169962920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207103.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Melissa~","Id":207103,"Name":"~Melissa~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf677ed4b7e60bc1e0d1a383f5ed6e05","RawContent":"Hi Ladies as most of you may know the whole swine flu outbreak in mexico has cancelled our wedding and now i want to get married at the Dreams Punta Cana. Can you ladies give me the email contact of your WC to see if I can get married here? I know on the site it says to book 125 days in advance but i only have 75, please someone help me out I don&#039;t want to scrap my wedding entirely. If any of you have any wedding information that the coordinators have sent you can you email it to me &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:bcarothers@drexan.com\"&gt;bcarothers@drexan.com&lt;\/a&gt; Thanks so much for all your help ladies this forum has truly been a lifesaver!","Attachments":[],"Id":672685,"PostDate":1240995620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies as most of you may know the whole swine flu outbreak in mexico has cancelled our wedding and now i want to get married at the Dreams Punta Cana. Can you ladies give me the email contact of your WC to see if I can get married here? I know on the site it says to book 125 days in advance but i only have 75, please someone help me out I don't want to scrap my wedding entirely. If any of you have any wedding information that the coordinators have sent you can you email it to me <a href='mailto:bcarothers@drexan.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>bcarothers@drexan.com<\/a> Thanks so much for all your help ladies this forum has truly been a lifesaver!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soccergurl4life_3@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1232483670,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214136.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soccergurl3","Id":214136,"Name":"soccergurl3","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4753,"TotalPages":476,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":4750},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
