{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":22428,"Author":{"Id":286212,"Name":"Rubyy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1455400816,"Content":"Hello! I'm getting married at Azul Fives this summer and saw that you just did yourself! First of all I want to start off by saying congratulations! <br><br \/>\nDo you mind me asing what package you got? I have chosen the pure glamour package and I am wondering if I should go down to a smaller package since I'm not gonna have a private reception? Any suggestions? ","PostKey":"e993e177005da0eaf0bd5b02e19a4f51","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":22429,"Author":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1455445696,"Content":"<p>Hi @Rubyy Thanks! We absolutely loved our wedding at Azul Fives! We had the best time!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just responded in the Azul Fives Brides 2016 thread. I tried to reply to this last night but your message disappeared from my inbox for some reason.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would definitely go with the basic package and add on the decor you like from there. We used the Always and Forever package. We kept our ceremony pretty simple and brought some of our own decor. I only got flowers from lomas for the ceremony. Most of the decor we brought was for our reception in the garden.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know if you have any other questions!<\/p>\n","PostKey":"655c783d416649e47907812ae50950b2","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
