{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.139.89","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79615,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36e5b8de2444e89f1323bfeb0fdd047b","RawContent":"@[member=\"ashhtayy\"] thanks for your response!!! I  will be moving to the Always &amp;amp; Forever package and customizing my own! Are you ready for your wedding!? \n\n\nAre you carrying your dress with you on a carry on when you fly? I&#039;m scared to send it in a suitcase &amp;amp; it get lost.","Attachments":[],"Id":1910852,"PostDate":1455450518,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282006\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282006-ashhtayy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ashhtayy<\/span><\/a> thanks for your response!!! I  will be moving to the Always & Forever package and customizing my own! Are you ready for your wedding!? <br><br>\nAre you carrying your dress with you on a carry on when you fly? I'm scared to send it in a suitcase & it get lost. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruby_12_basketball@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.195.193.123","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1455353528,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Rubyy","Id":286212,"Name":"Rubyy","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"151.224.174.155","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79615,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4414609b13e45ed93b552b22b1a94d3a","RawContent":"Yes @[member=\"Rubyy\"] we have chosen Shenko Photography. Their work looks amazing, however they aren&#039;t an approved photographer so there will be an $800 fee to pay for them to come into the hotel on your wedding day. To be honest, I don&#039;t care because their pictures look so amazing and they reply to emails really fast (I&#039;m in London, England). I can&#039;t wait to meet them I feel like I know them already. \n\n\nCheck them out! \n\n&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/shenkophotography\/\"&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/shenkophotography\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\n\nSarah","Attachments":[],"Id":1910853,"PostDate":1455450872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286212\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286212-rubyy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Rubyy<\/span><\/a> we have chosen Shenko Photography. Their work looks amazing, however they aren't an approved photographer so there will be an $800 fee to pay for them to come into the hotel on your wedding day. To be honest, I don't care because their pictures look so amazing and they reply to emails really fast (I'm in London, England). I can't wait to meet them I feel like I know them already. <br><br>\nCheck them out! <br><br><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/shenkophotography\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...nkophotography\/<\/a><br><br><br>\nSarah \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah_lhanna@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"151.224.162.187","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1448522372,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sassylouxx","Id":285443,"Name":"sassylouxx","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.88.49.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79615,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bbea560c111b36766ab9a5eeb146d69","RawContent":"@[member=\"Rubyy\"] No, definitely not ready but not in a panic - there&#039;s still time :) Most of the big things are out of the way at this point but need to set aside sometime to work on the little tedious things. \n\n\nI am absolutely carrying my dress on - no way I&#039;d put it in a suitcase. I would also be so scared it would get lost. I want to know exactly where it is at all times lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1910854,"PostDate":1455450914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286212\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286212-rubyy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Rubyy<\/span><\/a> No, definitely not ready but not in a panic - there's still time <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Most of the big things are out of the way at this point but need to set aside sometime to work on the little tedious things. <br><br>\nI am absolutely carrying my dress on - no way I'd put it in a suitcase. I would also be so scared it would get lost. I want to know exactly where it is at all times lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1423083461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":t